        "TileImage": "$($repository 51a0b47f-9bca-4880-9a1b-0ef158a17c5d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening, 47.  \r\rOur Client, a collector of historical artifacts, wishes you to infiltrate The Ark Society to reclaim an Aztec Necklace that was stolen from them by the infamous treasure hunter/burglar Blake Nathaniel. It is currently on display in the showroom with heavy security watching over it. \r\rOur client also has requested to put an end to our thief Blake and his accomplice, the Constantin, along together with some of his security.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
